        "answer": {
          "short": "$2^1+3^1=5=5^1$, so $x=1$ is a solution.",
          "worked": "Substitute $x=1$:\n$$\\begin{align*}2^1+3^1&=2+3\\\\2^1+3^1&=5.\\end{align*}$$\nThe right-hand side is $5^1=5$, so $x=1$ satisfies the equation.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 36
